  "statuteText": "659:47 Absentee Ballots Received Late. –\n\nNo absentee ballot shall be processed or counted unless it is delivered to the moderator at the proper polling place by the time identified in RSA 659:49, subject to exceptions identified in RSA 657:21-a and RSA 657:22."
